      "title": "Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "START HERE: install the packs RedNode Studio can use\n\nThis workflow renders nothing. It holds one node from each pack the Workspace can lean on, so\nComfyUI Manager finds them all at once instead of one at a time.\n\n1. Manager says some nodes are missing when this opens. Let it install them.\n2. Restart ComfyUI.\n3. Open RedNode Studio from the template browser and work from there. This file has done its job.\n\nThe Workspace needs none of these. The RedNode Studio template needs Light and Scene, the Style browser, the Text node, GGUF and the FlowMatch scheduler; everything else is optional. The Workspace renders without every one of them and says on the Run\ntab when a pass wanted one that is not here. Install what you want and skip the rest: the\nWorkspace Manager's Check installs button says which ones your own settings actually call for.\n\nLight and Scene (Krea2-BBOX-Prompter) is not on the Comfy Registry, so Manager cannot install it\nby name. In Manager choose Install via Git URL and paste\nhttps://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/Krea2-BBOX-Prompter"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
